== Tree Protection Order ==
'''{{Red|Tree Protection Orders}}''' are restrictions placed on certain trees around [[Galatea]]. Attempting to cut them will result in a {{c|1,000}} fine if the player has sufficient coins: instead, the player can lather them with [[Pots of Honeycomb]], spawning {{Green|1}} of {{Green|3}} exclusive {{Mt|Critter}} mobs.

